{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The source is a simultaneous catapult duel: charge timing, shrinking castles, and temporary attacks on the opposing crew create the tactics. The engine has a useful artillery kit, but its turn-based rules need replacing. The plan will preserve the source’s real-time play, with local versus for standalone multiplayer and shared-world sessions through AI Hub.\n"}}
